<concept importance="optional" id="t00561">
	<title>Forward Attention Warning (FAW)</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>forward attention warning (FAW)</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>Forward Attention Warning uses the in-cabin camera to help prevent the driver from being distracted while driving with an audible warning and warning light.</p>
		<section id="e04164">
			<title>Detecting sensor</title>
			<table frame="none" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc_none" id="e04165">
