					<colspec colnum="2" colname="2" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="0">
							<entry colname="1" colsep="0">
								<fig id="e04166">
									<figgroup>
										<image href="../../images/OOV055102L.eps" align="center" placement="break"/>
									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="2">
								<ol outputclass="callout" id="e04167">
									<li>
										<p> <uicontrol>In-cabin camera</uicontrol> </p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>The picture above shows the detailed location of the detecting sensor.</p>
			<note type="caution" id="e04168">
				<p>Always keep the in-cabin camera in good condition to maintain optimal performance of Forward Attention Warning.</p>
			</note>
